<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - July 15.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - July 15.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay  Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the close of Tuesday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change. The index at the close was 4221.02, 4.00 points or 0.09 percent lower than Monday's close.</p>
